#: views/dahdi_analog_settings.php:28
#: views/dahdi_analog_signalling_form.php:14
msgid "Loop Start"
msgstr "迴路啟動"

#: views/dahdi_analog_settings.php:20
msgid ""
"Loop Start - When idle, or on-hook, the loop potential is held a nominal 48V DC, provided by the telephone exchange or a foreign exchange station (FXS) interface. When a terminal initiates use the line, it causes current to flow by closing the loop, and this signals the FXS end to provide dial tone on the line and to expect dial signals, in form of DTMF digits or dial pulses, or a hook flash. When the loop is opened and current stops flowing, the subscriber equipment signals that it has finished using the line; the telephone exchange resets the line to an idle state."
msgstr "迴路啟動 - 空閒或掛機時，迴路電位保持在標稱 48V DC，由電話交換機或通道組提供。"

