#: views/dahdi_advanced_settings.php:57
#: views/dahdi_modprobe_settings.php:38
msgid ""
"Specify the On Hook Speed, Ringer Impedance, Ringer Threshold, Current limiting, Tip/Ring voltage adjustment, Minimum Operational Loop current, and AC Impedance selection as predefined for each countries' analog line characteristics. Select the country in which your Asterisk server is operating. FCC is equivalent to United States. TBR21 is equivalent to Austria, Belgium, Denmark, Finland, France, Germany, Greece, Iceland, Ireland, Italy, Luxembourg, Netherlands, Norway, Portugal, Spain, Sweden, Switzerland, and the United Kingdom. If no choice is specified, the default is FCC"
msgstr ""
"指定掛機速度、響鈴阻抗、響鈴臨界值、電流限制、Tip/Ring 電壓調整。這是一個從 0 到 15 的值，代表對應 wctdm 模組參數的設定。"

#: views/dahdi_modprobe_settings.php:121
msgid ""
"Specify the audio compression scheme (codec) to be used for analog lines. North American users should choose ulaw. All other countries, unless otherwise known, should be assumed to be alaw. If no choice is specified, the default is ulaw. Confirm the scheme which will be best for operation"
msgstr "指定要用於類比線路的音訊壓縮方案（編解碼器）。北美使用者通常使用 mulaw，其他地區使用 alaw。"

#: views/dahdi_advanced_settings.php:136
msgid ""
"Specify the audio compression scheme (codec) to be used for analog lines. North American users should choose ulaw. All other countries, unless otherwise known, should be assumed to be alaw. If no choice is specified, the default is ulaw. Confirm the scheme which will be best for operation."
msgstr "指定要用於類比線路的音訊壓縮方案（編解碼器）。北美使用者通常使用 mulaw，其他地區使用 alaw。"

#: views/dahdi_modprobe_settings.php:9
msgid "Specify the kernel module used by the installed analog hardware"
msgstr "指定已安裝類比硬體使用的核心模組"

#: views/dahdi_advanced_settings.php:7
msgid "Specify the kernel module used by the installed analog hardware."
msgstr "指定已安裝類比硬體使用的核心模組。"

#: views/dahdi_global_settings.php:9
msgid "Specify the language"
msgstr "指定語言"

#: views/dahdi_advanced_settings.php:184
#: views/dahdi_modprobe_settings.php:193
msgid ""
"Specify the type of Message Waiting Indicator detection to be done on FXO ports. If no choice is specified, the default is none. The following options are available"
msgstr "指定要在 FXO 連接埠上執行的訊息等待指示器偵測類型。如果未指定選擇，驅動程式預設為無。"

#: views/dahdi_modprobe_settings.php:145
msgid ""
"Specify the voltage used for ringing an analog phone. Normal will set the ring voltage to 40V, and Peak will set the voltage to 89V. If no choice is specified, the default is normal"
msgstr "指定用於響鈴類比電話的電壓。正常會將響鈴電壓設為 40V，峰值（89v）會將響鈴電壓設為 89V。"

#: views/dahdi_advanced_settings.php:152
msgid ""
"Specify the voltage used for ringing an analog phone. Normal will set the ring voltage to 40V, and Peak will set the voltage to 89V. If no choice is specified, the default is normal."
msgstr "指定用於響鈴類比電話的電壓。正常會將響鈴電壓設為 40V，峰值（89v）會將響鈴電壓設為 89V。"

#: views/dahdi_global_settings.php:184
msgid ""
"Specify whether the channel should be answered immediately or if the simple switch should provide dialtone, read digits, etc"
msgstr "指定通道應立即應答，還是簡單交換機應提供撥號音。"

#: views/dahdi_modprobe_settings.php:157
msgid ""
"Specify whether to apply Fast Ringer operation. Setting Fast Ringer (25Hz) (commonly used in conjunction with the Low Power option) increases the ringing speed to 25Hz. If no choice is specified, the default is normal"
msgstr "指定是否套用快速響鈴操作。設定快速響鈴（25Hz）（通常與低功率一起使用）將減少響鈴節奏。"

#: views/dahdi_advanced_settings.php:160
msgid ""
"Specify whether to apply Fast Ringer operation. Setting Fast Ringer (25Hz) (commonly used in conjunction with the Low Power option) increases the ringing speed to 25Hz. If no choice is specified, the default is normal."
msgstr "指定是否套用快速響鈴操作。設定快速響鈴（25Hz）（通常與低功率一起使用）將減少響鈴節奏。"

#: views/dahdi_modprobe_settings.php:169
msgid ""
"Specify whether to apply Low Power operation. Setting Fast Ringer to 50V peak in conjunction with the Fast Ringer option increases the peak voltage during Fast Ringer operation to 50V. If no choice is specified, the default is normal"
msgstr "指定是否套用低功率操作。將快速響鈴設為 50V 峰值並搭配此設定，將為使用者提供更長的話機壽命。"

#: views/dahdi_advanced_settings.php:168
msgid ""
"Specify whether to apply Low Power operation. Setting Fast Ringer to 50V peak in conjunction with the Fast Ringer option increases the peak voltage during Fast Ringer operation to 50V. If no choice is specified, the default is normal."
msgstr "指定是否套用低功率操作。將快速響鈴設為 50V 峰值並搭配此設定，將為使用者提供更長的話機壽命。"

#: views/dahdi_modprobe_settings.php:181
msgid ""
"Specify whether to apply normal ring detection, or a full wave detection to prevent false ring detection for lines where CallerID is sent before the first ring and proceeded by a polarity reversal (as in the United Kingdom). If you are experiencing trouble with detecting CallerID from analog service providers, or have lines which exhibit a polarity reversal before CallerID is transmitted from the provider, then select Full Wave. If no choice is specified, the default is standard"
msgstr "指定是否套用正常響鈴偵測，或全波偵測以防止誤判響鈴。"

#: views/dahdi_advanced_settings.php:176
msgid ""
"Specify whether to apply normal ring detection, or a full wave detection to prevent false ring detection for lines where CallerID is sent before the first ring and proceeded by a polarity reversal (as in the United Kingdom). If you are experiencing trouble with detecting CallerID from analog service providers, or have lines which exhibit a polarity reversal before CallerID is transmitted from the provider, then select Full Wave. If no choice is specified, the default is standard."
msgstr "指定是否套用正常響鈴偵測，或全波偵測以防止誤判響鈴。"

#: views/dahdi_modprobe_settings.php:133
msgid ""
"Specify whether to apply the opermode setting to your FXO modules only, or to both FXS and FXO modules. If no choice is specified, the default is apply opermode to fxo modules only"
msgstr "指定是僅將運作模式設定套用至 FXO 模組，還是同時套用至 FXS 和 FXO 模組。"

#: views/dahdi_advanced_settings.php:144
