msgid ""
"This message will re-appear everytime you load the module while it is in a disabled write state so as to not cause any confusion"
msgstr "每次在停用寫入狀態下載入模組時，此訊息都會重新出現，請接受它。"

#: page.dahdi.php:188
msgid ""
"This module should never be used alongside \"dahdi_genconfig\". Using \"dahdi_genconfig\" and this module at the same time can have unexpected consequences."
msgstr "此模組絕不應與「dahdi_genconfig」同時使用。同時使用「dahdi_genconfig」和此模組可能會導致設定損毀。"

#: views/dahdi_modprobe_settings.php:246
msgid ""
"This option allows you to specify the threshold, in dB difference between the received audio (post echo cancellation) and the transmitted audio, for when the NLP will engage (VPMADT032 only). The default setting is 24 dB"
msgstr "此選項允許您指定接收音訊（迴音消除後）與套用 NLP 之間的 dB 差異臨界值。"

#: views/dahdi_advanced_settings.php:224
msgid ""
"This option allows you to specify the threshold, in dB difference between the received audio (post echo cancellation) and the transmitted audio, for when the NLP will engage (VPMADT032 only). The default setting is 24 dB."
msgstr "此選項允許您指定接收音訊（迴音消除後）與套用 NLP 之間的 dB 差異臨界值。"

#: views/dahdi_advanced_settings.php:206
#: views/dahdi_modprobe_settings.php:224
msgid ""
"This option allows you to specify the type of Non Linear Processor you want applied to the post echo-cancelled audio reflections received from analog connections (VPMADT032 only). There are several options"
msgstr "此選項允許您指定接收音訊（迴音消除後）與套用 NLP 之間的 dB 差異臨界值。"

#: views/dahdi_analog_settings.php:17
msgid ""
"This option allows you to specify the type signaling for this analog device."
msgstr "此選項允許您指定接收音訊（迴音消除後）與套用 NLP 之間的 dB 差異臨界值。"

#: views/dahdi_modprobe_settings.php:258
msgid ""
"This option, only functional when the Echo Cancellation NLP Type option is set to Suppression NLP, specifies the maximum amount of dB that the NLP should attenuate the residual echo (VPMADT032 only). Lower numbers mean that the NLP will provide less suppression (the residual echo will sound louder). Higher numbers, especially those approaching or equaling the Echo Cancellation NLP Threshold option, will nearly mute the residual echo. The default setting is 24 dB"
msgstr "此選項僅在迴音消除 NLP 類型設為抑制 NLP 時才起作用，指定套用至迴音反射的抑制量（以 dB 為單位）。"

#: views/dahdi_advanced_settings.php:228
msgid ""
"This option, only functional when the Echo Cancellation NLP Type option is set to Suppression NLP, specifies the maximum amount of dB that the NLP should attenuate the residual echo (VPMADT032 only). Lower numbers mean that the NLP will provide less suppression (the residual echo will sound louder). Higher numbers, especially those approaching or equaling the Echo Cancellation NLP Threshold option, will nearly mute the residual echo. The default setting is 24 dB."
msgstr "此選項僅在迴音消除 NLP 類型設為抑制 NLP 時才起作用，指定套用至迴音反射的抑制量（以 dB 為單位）。"

